 "remarks": "Discover the perfect blend of comfort and convenience in this thoughtfully updated, first-floor ranch-style condominium. The bright and airy interior features an open layout with gleaming hardwood floors throughout. You will appreciate the convenience of the in-unit washer and dryer. The living space extends outdoors with a vast private patio-the perfect retreat for morning coffee, summer entertaining, or unwinding after a long day. This move-in-ready home is situated in a prime location within walking distance to the Glenbrook Metro-North station, shopping, restaurants, parks, and more. This property offers an outstanding investment opportunity with exceptionally low common charges, no rental restrictions, and added bonuses such as dedicated assigned parking and a private storage unit. Don't miss out on this rare opportunity to own a gem that truly checks every box in a highly desirable neighborhood. Schedule your private tour today! click on movie icon for virtual tour.",
